;          seconds conversion needs the 1e6 — its ≈2.17e-14 s value
;          and its floors are right), and one second is TPQ·1e6 ticks
;          = 46 126 080 000 000
;   a frame at [1 100] is 100 s = 4 612 608 000 000 000 ticks
;   0.000000000000002f is 2e-15 frames = 2e-13 s = 9.225216 ticks —
